        "test_summary": "Test Volatility API calculation. Validates monthly and annualized volatility calculations for blended portfolios and benchmarks.",
        "test_scenario": "Validate volatility API response contains correct monthly volatility (standard deviation) and annualized volatility (monthly × sqrt(12)) for model blends and benchmarks."
    }
